    "notes": {
        "be2ffd78-a6ca-4a7f-9e09-6ed67eb3faa4": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 560,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Trigger test assumptions\n\n- The trigger registers a Stripe webhook endpoint when the flow starts and deletes it when the flow stops. Stripe allows at most 16 endpoints per account: delete stale ones in the Dashboard (Developers → Webhooks) if the start fails.\n- **Keep the Wait 1m** before the provoking step so the endpoint is live.\n- The provoke confirms a 19.99 USD payment intent with the `pm_card_visa` test payment method (test mode only).\n- Use a test-mode secret key; other activity in the same account during the run can fire the trigger and fail the Assert."
        }
